eam%20base%3A%20%601aee767ef57b84a8191511a08955c583b65de382%60.%0A-%20**50%20of%2062%20new%20regression%20cases%20fail%20on%20unchanged%20source**%3B%20all%2062%20pass%20after%20the%20change.%0A-%20Coverage%20includes%20nullable%20Boolean%2FInt64%2FFloat64%20and%20object%20representations%2C%20mixed-column%20frames%2C%20all-missing%20frames%2C%20explicit%20observed-transaction%20support%20calculations%2C%20rule-metric%20equivalence%2C%20invalid%20values%2C%20missing-values-disabled%20behavior%2C%20input%20preservation%2C%20and%20ordinary%20dense%2Fsparse%20controls.%0A-%20Relevant%20frequent-pattern%20tests%3A%20**173%20passed**.%20Complete%20repository%20suite%3A%20**802%20passed%2C%203%20skipped**.%0A-%20Baseline%20and%20patch%20ran%20in%20the%20same%20Python%203.11.18%20job%20with%20the%20unchanged%20frozen%20lock.%0A-%20Complete%20repository%20isort%2FBlack%2C%20changed-file%20Flake8%2C%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%2C%20package%20build%2C%20and%20strict%20Twine%20checks%20passed.%20The%20repository-wide%20Flake8%20report%20retains%20existing%20findings%20and%20is%20not%20presented%20as%20a%20clean%20lint%20gate.%0A%0A%5BBaseline%20and%20complete%20validation%20evidence%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Fgeoopt%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43890956710%2Fjob%2F133381680363).%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Pull%20Request%20Checklist%0A%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Added%20a%20changelog%20entry.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Added%20regression%20tests%20in%20the%20corresponding%20test%20directory.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Documented%20supported%20missing-value%20representations.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Ran%20focused%20and%20full%20repository%20tests.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Checked%20formatting%20and%20style%20with%20the%20scope%20described%20above.%0A",
